    "OPass can send you notification just before the session starts.\\nWould you like to allow OPass notifications in Settings?" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "OPass can send you notification just before the session starts.\\nWould you like to allow OPass notifications in Settings?"
          }
        },
        "id" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "OPass dapat mengirimkan notifikasi kepada Anda sesaat sebelum sesi dimulai.\nApakah Anda ingin mengizinkan notifikasi OPass di Pengaturan?"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "OPassはセッション開始直前に通知を送信できます。\\n設定でOPassの通知を許可しますか？"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "OPass는 세션이 시작되기 전에 알림을 보내 드릴 수 있습니다.\\n설정에서 OPass 알림을 허용하시겠습니까?"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "OPass 可以在議程開始前向您發送通知。\\n您想在「設定」中允許 OPass 通知嗎？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
